obj_id: agentGenerated_RegionalSalesAndProfitabilityRiskAnalysi-c6353e97
liveboard:
  name: agentGenerated_Regional Sales And Profitability Risk Analysis
  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: a2deef3a-7f6d-4c85-94c7-cf6ec225812a
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • Central region shows critical profit margin of only 7.9% vs 14.9% in West despite high sales volume
        • South region has lowest sales at $391,722, 27% below West's performance
        • Central generates 2nd highest sales ($501,240) but delivers lowest total profit ($39,706)
        • Significant profit efficiency gap with West outperforming Central by 88% on margins

        Recommendations:
        • Immediately review Central region's cost structure and discount policies to improve 7.9% margin
        • Implement South region growth initiatives to address $334K sales gap vs top performer
        • Analyze West region's best practices for replication across underperforming markets
  - id: Viz_2
    answer:
